<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Teljoys cautions on parent's unbundling.</title>
<headline>Teljoys cautions on parent's unbundling.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teljoy Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday that the unbundling of controlling shareholder, Servgro International Ltd, as it affects Teljoy, had not been finalised.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
